# NOTE on knowledge/ (the private corpus: CV + project dossiers).
# It is deliberately NOT ignored here: `npm run db:ingest` reads it from
# process.cwd(), and that runs from the `builder` stage via the `migrate`
# service in docker-compose.prod.yml. Keeping it out of the build context would
# break ingestion. It must not survive into the runtime image though -- Next's
# standalone output copies the project root, so the runner stage deletes it
# explicitly (see the `rm -rf ./knowledge` in Dockerfile).
